#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:4
msgid "v2.6.8"
msgstr "v2.6.8"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.6.8 refreshes the bundled firmware to 3.8.0, reorganizes the example "
"library into ``Arduino`` and ``OpenMV`` folders, and updates the bundled API"
" documentation used by the help and autocomplete systems. It remains based "
"on Qt Creator 4.0.2. The example reorganization changes the ``Examples`` "
"menu paths; see Breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v2.6.8 將內建韌體更新至 3.8.0、把範例庫重新組織為 ``Arduino`` 與 ``OpenMV`` "
"資料夾，並更新了說明與自動完成系統所使用的內建 API 文件。它仍以 Qt Creator 4.0.2 為基礎。範例的重新組織變更了 "
"``Examples`` 選單路徑；請參閱下方的重大變更。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本頁內容"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "重點功能"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Bundled firmware 3.8.0** for OPENMV2, OPENMV3, OPENMV4, OPENMV4P, and "
"PORTENTA."
msgstr "**內建韌體 3.8.0**\\ ，適用於 OPENMV2、OPENMV3、OPENMV4、OPENMV4P 與 PORTENTA。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Reorganized examples** into top-level ``Arduino`` and ``OpenMV`` folders, "
"with new ``37-Audio`` and ``38-Ethernet`` categories and new image-drawing "
"tests."
msgstr ""
"**重新組織的範例** 整理為頂層的 ``Arduino`` 與 ``OpenMV`` 資料夾，新增了 ``37-Audio`` 與 "
"``38-Ethernet`` 分類以及新的影像繪製測試。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Refreshed API documentation** adding ``network.LAN``, ``network.WLAN``, "
"``omv.audio``, ``omv.micro_speech``, and ``uasyncio`` and dropping the "
"obsolete ``omv.nn`` and ``omv.time`` references for the docs and "
"autocomplete."
msgstr ""
"**更新的 API 文件** 為文件與自動完成新增了 ``network.LAN``\\ 、\\ ``network.WLAN``\\ 、\\ "
"``omv.audio``\\ 、\\ ``omv.micro_speech`` 與 ``uasyncio``\\ ，並移除了過時的 "
"``omv.nn`` 與 ``omv.time`` 參照。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Fixed module-documentation parsing** so multi-section module docs are read"
" correctly for help and autocomplete."
msgstr "**修正模組文件解析** ，使多區段的模組文件能被正確讀取，供說明與自動完成使用。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:32
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Reorganized example library** into ``Arduino`` and ``OpenMV`` top-level "
"folders. New categories were added, including ``37-Audio`` (``audio_fft``, "
"``micro_speech``) and ``38-Ethernet`` (``http_client``, ``http_client_ssl``,"
" ``peer_to_peer``), along with new ``03-Drawing`` image-drawing tests for "
"alpha blending, alpha table, and scale up/down. The default "
"``helloworld.py`` path and the Register dialog text were updated to match "
"the new ``Examples->OpenMV->Basics`` location. During the reorg three "
"thermopile-shield examples were removed outright: ``AMG8833_camera_lcd.py``,"
" ``MLX90621_camera_lcd.py``, and ``MLX90640_camera_lcd.py``; their "
"``*_camera.py``, ``*_overlay.py``, and ``*_overlay_lcd.py`` siblings were "
"retained and moved into the new tree (`49e63811f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/49e63811f>`__, `e2bac7aa8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e2bac7aa8>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**重新組織的範例庫** 整理為 ``Arduino`` 與 ``OpenMV`` 頂層資料夾。新增了多個分類，包括 ``37-Audio``\\ "
"（\\ ``audio_fft``\\ 、\\ ``micro_speech``\\ ）與 ``38-Ethernet``\\ （\\ "
"``http_client``\\ 、\\ ``http_client_ssl``\\ 、\\ ``peer_to_peer``\\ ），以及新的 "
"``03-Drawing`` 影像繪製測試，用於 alpha 混合、alpha 表與放大／縮小。預設的 ``helloworld.py`` 路徑與 "
"Register 對話框文字已更新，以符合新的 ``Examples->OpenMV->Basics`` "
"位置。在重組過程中，有三個熱電堆擴充板範例被直接移除：\\ ``AMG8833_camera_lcd.py``\\ 、\\ "
"``MLX90621_camera_lcd.py`` 與 ``MLX90640_camera_lcd.py``\\ ；它們的 "
"``*_camera.py``\\ 、\\ ``*_overlay.py`` 與 ``*_overlay_lcd.py`` "
"同類範例則被保留並移入新的目錄結構（\\ `49e63811f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/49e63811f>`__\\ 、\\ `e2bac7aa8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e2bac7aa8>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:49
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他變更與改進"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Refreshed bundled MicroPython/OpenMV API documentation** used by the IDE's"
" docs and autocomplete. New modules include ``network.LAN``, "
"``network.WLAN``, ``omv.audio``, ``omv.micro_speech``, and ``uasyncio``, "
"with updated ``omv.image`` and ``omv.lcd`` references; the obsolete "
"``omv.nn`` and ``omv.time`` module references were removed from the docs and"
" autocomplete (`d45f145b0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d45f145b0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**更新了 IDE 文件與自動完成所使用的內建 MicroPython/OpenMV API 文件。** 新模組包括 ``network.LAN``\\"
" 、\\ ``network.WLAN``\\ 、\\ ``omv.audio``\\ 、\\ ``omv.micro_speech`` 與 "
"``uasyncio``\\ ，並更新了 ``omv.image`` 與 ``omv.lcd`` 的參照；過時的 ``omv.nn`` 與 "
"``omv.time`` 模組參照已從文件與自動完成中移除（\\ `d45f145b0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d45f145b0>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:57
msgid ""
"Normalized the module-section ids in the bundled library index to the "
"canonical Sphinx ``module-<name>`` form for ``ulab``, ``pid``, ``bno055``, "
"``ssd1306``, ``tb6612``, ``vl53l1x``, ``modbus``, and ``mqtt``, which the "
"documentation parser was updated to recognize (`c58a6e332 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c58a6e332>`__)."
msgstr ""
"將內建庫索引中的模組區段 id 正規化為 ``ulab``\\ 、\\ ``pid``\\ 、\\ ``bno055``\\ 、\\ "
"``ssd1306``\\ 、\\ ``tb6612``\\ 、\\ ``vl53l1x``\\ 、\\ ``modbus`` 與 ``mqtt`` "
"的標準 Sphinx ``module-<name>`` 形式，並更新了文件解析器以辨識它們（\\ `c58a6e332 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c58a6e332>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:62
msgid ""
"The DFU firmware-update and video-conversion output dialogs now render their"
" log text in the editor's fixed-width font for readability (`94440b081 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/94440b081>`__)."
msgstr ""
"DFU 韌體更新與影片轉換的輸出對話框現在會以編輯器的等寬字型來算繪其記錄文字，以提高可讀性（\\ `94440b081 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/94440b081>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:67
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "錯誤修正"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:69
msgid ""
"Fixed the module-documentation HTML parser so it iterates all module "
"sections and tolerates dotted ids up to five segments, so multi-section "
"module docs are parsed correctly for the help and autocomplete system "
"(`1044a84d0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1044a84d0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修正了模組文件 HTML 解析器，使其迭代所有模組區段並容許至多五段的點分隔 id，使多區段的模組文件能被正確解析，供說明與自動完成系統使用（\\ "
"`1044a84d0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1044a84d0>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:73
msgid ""
"Reverted the \"DFU firmware update complete!\" confirmation message back to "
"plain text. An earlier attempt to bold the header by wrapping it in "
"``<b></b>`` tags caused the literal HTML tags to be shown in the message "
"box, so the tags were removed (`26f02ab08 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/26f02ab08>`__, `5ac140a0d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5ac140a0d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"將「DFU firmware update complete!」確認訊息還原為純文字。先前嘗試以 ``<b></b>`` "
"標籤包覆標題使其變粗體的做法，導致訊息框中顯示出字面上的 HTML 標籤，因此移除了這些標籤（\\ `26f02ab08 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/26f02ab08>`__\\ 、\\ `5ac140a0d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5ac140a0d>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:81
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "平台與工具支援"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:83
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 4.0.2."
msgstr "**Qt Creator 基礎：** 4.0.2。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:84
msgid ""
"**Bundled OpenMV firmware:** 3.6.9 -> 3.8.0 for OPENMV2, OPENMV3, OPENMV4, "
"OPENMV4P, and PORTENTA, rebuilding the firmware, bootloader, and UVC "
"binaries and DFU images (`d37de33f7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d37de33f7>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**內建 OpenMV 韌體：** 已為 OPENMV2、OPENMV3、OPENMV4、OPENMV4P 與 PORTENTA 從 3.6.9 更新至"
" 3.8.0，重新建置了韌體、開機載入程式與 UVC 二進位檔及 DFU 映像檔（\\ `d37de33f7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d37de33f7>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:90
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "重大變更"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:92
msgid ""
"The bundled examples were reorganized into two top-level folders, "
"``Arduino`` and ``OpenMV``, so the ``Examples`` menu paths changed. For "
"example, ``Examples->Basics->helloworld.py`` is now "
"``Examples->OpenMV->Basics->helloworld.py``. Any external references or "
"muscle-memory pointing at the old example paths will be off. This affects "
"example navigation only; it does not break user project scripts."
msgstr ""
"內建範例已重新組織為兩個頂層資料夾，\\ ``Arduino`` 與 ``OpenMV``\\ ，因此 ``Examples`` "
"選單路徑已變更。例如，\\ ``Examples->Basics->helloworld.py`` 現在是 "
"``Examples->OpenMV->Basics->helloworld.py``\\ "
"。任何指向舊範例路徑的外部參照或肌肉記憶都將失準。這僅影響範例導覽；不會破壞使用者的專案指令碼。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.8.rst:98
msgid ""
"Three thermopile-shield examples were removed from the bundled library: "
"``AMG8833_camera_lcd.py``, ``MLX90621_camera_lcd.py``, and "
"``MLX90640_camera_lcd.py``. The remaining ``*_camera.py``, ``*_overlay.py``,"
" and ``*_overlay_lcd.py`` variants for each sensor were retained and moved "
"into the new example tree (`49e63811f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/49e63811f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"從內建庫中移除了三個熱電堆擴充板範例：\\ ``AMG8833_camera_lcd.py``\\ 、\\ "
"``MLX90621_camera_lcd.py`` 與 ``MLX90640_camera_lcd.py``\\ 。各感測器其餘的 "
"``*_camera.py``\\ 、\\ ``*_overlay.py`` 與 ``*_overlay_lcd.py`` "
"變體則被保留並移入新的範例目錄結構（\\ `49e63811f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/49e63811f>`__\\ ）。"
